{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":false,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":100,"mirrow":false,"y":-304,"img":"chara051_1","addImg":"chara051_1_face_chara051_1c"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":false,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"timeBak":300,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":0,"scaleY":1,"nonStandBright":false,"x":100,"mirrow":false,"y":-304,"img":"chara051_1","addImg":"chara051_1_face_chara051_1c"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"阿莱克西娅","text":"[show]受各位照顾，我在这里过的已经十分舒适，哪还有什么别的需要可提呢。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"阿莱克西娅","text":"[show]不过，我倒是有一个想法。我想邀请各位，有闲暇的时候，不妨来尾指村做客吧。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara051_1_face_chara051_1b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"阿莱克西娅","text":"[show]是的，就是我们生活的村子。虽然是个清贫的小渔村，不过大家都很善良热心，他们一定会欢迎你们的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"阿莱克西娅","text":"[show]那边不像大城市，没有什么娱乐，但靠近魔爪湖，风光还是很美丽的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"阿莱克西娅","text":"[show]而且，那里还有一片仿佛仙境的花海，没有见过那片景色，简直是人生的损失。不过，那些水纹花粉会造成幻觉，如果你们真有机会去，一定要让水占师陪同，才能无事。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara051_1_face_chara051_1c"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"阿莱克西娅","text":"[show]想请你们去做客，也是为了报答你们招待我来这么棒的营地。你们让我有这么美好的体验，我也想用美好的体验来回报你们。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara051_1_face_chara051_1b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":100,"mirrow":false,"y":-304,"img":"chara051_1","addImg":"chara051_1_face_chara051_1b"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"阿莱克西娅","text":"[show]那些尾指村的孩子们，一定也会欢迎您前去的。[r][l]您可不要忘了，您说过我们以后会一起照顾他们的……对吧？[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":100,"mirrow":false,"y":-304,"img":"chara051_1","addImg":"chara051_1_face_chara051_1b"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"阿莱克西娅-有没有想在这里做的事？","script":"sj_051_03"}